
# Button group — headless. Groups buttons into a segmented control. Theme the joined borders/radius in CSS.
load @cluesurf/site/code/zone/render
  find element
load @cluesurf/site/code/dom/dom
  find view
  find append

zone button-group
  take host, like view
  take class
  zone div
    bind data-slot, text <button-group>
    bind class, read class
    slot
